                <textElement textAlignment="Center" verticalAlignment="Middle">
                    <font fontName="Arial" size="12" isBold="true"/>
                </textElement>
                <text><![CDATA[Name and Address of Nominee for Employee Group Life Insurance Cover]]></text>
            </staticText>
            <staticText>
                <reportElement x="4" y="28" width="531" height="108" uuid="0721533f-ae02-495d-8854-d8954797ad6d"/>
                <textElement textAlignment="Justified"/>
                <text><![CDATA[Please list the Nominee(s) to whom you want the benefits to be paid in the event of your demise. (This will be applicable to the Life Insurance Policy as well as the Company Final Settlement).

1. Enter the Nominee’s name, address, and relationship to you.
2. Indicate whether this Nominee is PRIMARY or CONTINGENT. Primary Nominee(s) receive the benefits first in the event of your demise. Contingent Nominee(s) receive the benefits if the primary Nominee is no more.
3. Indicate the percentage of the benefits that you would like for each Nominee to receive. Total percentage must equal 100% for Primary Nominee and 100% for Contingent Nominee (if designated)]]></text>
            </staticText>
            <break>
                <reportElement x="0" y="4" width="100" height="1" uuid="a7d54f34-a97e-4937-8a34-a53f3be30e59"/>
            </break>
